<h3 id="in-a-form">In a form</h3>
<p>A field with <code>data-tab-field</code> receives the open tab's name, so the controller can redirect back to it
    (<code>/admin/pages/7#seo</code>). A field that fails native validation on a hidden tab opens its tab.</p>
<ui-doc-code id="in-a-form-code" lang="razor">
<form method="post" class="dnf-form">
    <input type="hidden" name="tab" data-tab-field />
    <div data-tabs data-initial-tab="general">
        <div class="dnf-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Page settings">…</div>
        <section class="dnf-tab-panel" role="tabpanel" data-tab-panel="general">…</section>
        <section class="dnf-tab-panel" role="tabpanel" data-tab-panel="seo">…</section>
    </div>
</form>
</ui-doc-code>

